   (性別 (<u><span style="color:green;">A</span> <span style="color:red;">D E F H I</span></u>)
   (<u><span style="color:green;">B C</span> <span style="color:red;">G J</span></u>))  
   と表す
-  この (<span style="color:green;">A</span> <span style="color:red;">D E F H I</span>) と
   (<span style="color:green;">B C</span> <span style="color:red;">G J</span>) を  
